OL,3,AAt least 12 dead as wildfires sweep
OL,4,Athrough northern Algeria
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 people have been killed and
OL,7,Fdozens injured as wildfires burn
OL,8,Fthrough large swathes of northern
OL,9,FAlgeria.
OL,11,FCivil protection authorities said
OL,12,Fdozens of blazes swept through several
OL,13,Fprovinces along the country's northern
OL,14,Fcoastline.
OL,16,FAt least 54 people had suffered burn
OL,17,Finjuries, with at least six of them
OL,18,Fbeing treated in intensive care,
OL,19,FInterior Minister Said Sayoud said on
OL,20,FWednesday night.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
