OL,3,AAt least 12 dead as wildfires sweep
OL,4,Athrough northern Algeria
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deaths comes as northern Africa
OL,7,Fswelters under a severe heatwave, with
OL,8,FTunisia and Algeria particularly
OL,9,Faffected.
